================================================================================
Third-party software bundled with YTBR
================================================================================

YTBR ships two standalone executables ("sidecars") that are invoked by
the application but remain independent programs. They are not statically
linked into the YTBR binary.

  yt-dlp
    Homepage: https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp
    License:  The Unlicense (public domain)

  ffmpeg (LGPL build)
    Homepage: https://ffmpeg.org/
    Source:   https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds
    License:  GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 or later (LGPL-2.1-or-later)

    The bundled ffmpeg binary is built without GPL-only components. Per
    LGPL Section 6, end users may replace it: locate the ffmpeg sidecar
    inside the YTBR installation directory and substitute a compatible
    binary. The full LGPL text and a pointer to upstream sources are
    reproduced in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md.

